{"2983520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tile Tales: Pirate", "steam_appid": 2983520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/1ca9ec94b74efc83b1121192cb1c4712.avif?t=1781959031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras_big/1ca9ec94b74efc83b1121192cb1c4712.avif?t=1781959031 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.poster.avif?t=1781959031\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.webm?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.mp4?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One pirate. One mysterious island. Absolutely no sense of self-preservation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Tales: Pirate is a colorful tile-sliding puzzle adventure about a hopelessly treasure-obsessed Pirate and the trouble he causes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/954103c9b3d64f2d81f7466e06f24de3.avif?t=1781959031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras_big/954103c9b3d64f2d81f7466e06f24de3.avif?t=1781959031 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/f49f31b80dc33dadf0a67da539346575.poster.avif?t=1781959031\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/f49f31b80dc33dadf0a67da539346575.webm?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/f49f31b80dc33dadf0a67da539346575.mp4?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide path tiles to guide the Pirate toward the exit. He sets off as soon as the route opens, so plan ahead, react quickly, and rearrange the world beneath his feet. Each chapter introduces new obstacles, creatures, and puzzle twists as his search for shiny treasure leads him deeper across the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/b7b348ea99fe62647d7d947244beb5e3.avif?t=1781959031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras_big/b7b348ea99fe62647d7d947244beb5e3.avif?t=1781959031 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List of features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 60 handcrafted tile-sliding puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six colorful chapters with distinct environments and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter animated characters, creatures, and dangerous obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden treasure and master every puzzle to achieve three stars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a lighthearted pirate adventure filled with whimsy and comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with mouse, keyboard, or controller</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/1ca9ec94b74efc83b1121192cb1c4712.avif?t=1781959031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras_big/1ca9ec94b74efc83b1121192cb1c4712.avif?t=1781959031 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.poster.avif?t=1781959031\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.webm?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/0fa02597be56db26b5d45d4cd2b9eca0.mp4?t=1781959031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One pirate. One mysterious island. Absolutely no sense of self-preservation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tile Tales: Pirate is a colorful tile-sliding puzzle adventure about a hopelessly treasure-obsessed Pirate and the trouble he causes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras/954103c9b3d64f2d81f7466e06f24de3.avif?t=1781959031\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983520/extras_big/954103c9b3d64f2d81f7466e06f24de3.avif?t=1781959031 width=800 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/